{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02665","headline":"过严君平古井 · 郑世翼","name":"过严君平古井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严平本高尚，远蹈古人风。\n卖卜成都市，流名大汉中。\n旧井改人世，寒泉久不通。\n多年既罢汲，无禽乃遂空。\n如何属秋气，唯见落双桐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑世翼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}